). Pathological biopsy served as the universal reference standard. Comprehensive study characteristics appear in Tables 1 , 2 and 3 . Table 1 Characteristics of included studies Author, year Country Study design Reference standard Device External validation ARA SR, 2015 [ 37 ] Bangladesh Retrospective Histopathology SonixTOUCH Research No Dong L, 2025 [ 38 ] China Retrospective Histopathology Aixplorer ultrasound system No Fujioka T, 2020 [ 39 ] Japan Retrospective Histopathology Aplio 500 scanner No Fukuda T, 2023 [ 40 ] Japan Retrospective Histopathology EUB-8500, HITACHI Medical Corp No Jiang M, 2021 [ 41 ] China Retrospective Histopathology Supersonic Aixplorer system Yes La Rocca LR, 2024 [ 42 ] Italy Retrospective Histopathology LOGIQ S8, GE No Li G, 2025 [ 43 ] China Retrospective Histopathology Mindray Resona 7 Yes Li X, 2024 [ 44 ] China Retrospective Histopathology LOGIQ E9, GE No Liu X, 2022 [ 45 ] China Retrospective Histopathology HI VISION Preirus system No Lo CM, 2015 [ 46 ] Taiwan Retrospective Histopathology ACUSON S2000 ultrasound system No Pfob A, 2022 [ 47 ] German Retrospective Histopathology Siemens ACUSON 2000 systems Yes Wang T, 2022 [ 48 ] China Retrospective Histopathology Hitachi VisionPreirus/Samsung RS80A No Yang K, 2023 [ 49 ] China Retrospective Histopathology Mindray Resona 7 Yes Zha H, 2024 [ 50 ] China Retrospective Histopathology Samsung RS80A No Zhang X, 2020 [ 51 ] China Retrospective Histopathology Aixplorer,SuperSonic Imagine Yes Zhang Y, 2016 [ 52 ] China Retrospective Histopathology Hitachi VisionPreirus No Table 2 Characteristics of included studies Author, year ML/DL Algorithm architecture Patients/ Lesions Positive Patients(lesions)/ Negative Patients(lesions) Data range ARA SR, 2015  [ 37 ] ML genetic algorithm 170/201 44(56)/126(145) NR Dong L, 2025  [ 38 ] DL CNN; DCFAN 218/387 NR(192)/NR(195) 2020.07–2021.12 Fujioka T, 2020  [ 39 ] DL CNN; DenseNet169 363/377 176(181)/187(196) 2014.03–2018.06 Fukuda T, 2023  [ 40 ] DL 